><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250709155155+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250709155203+10'00'" name="feb1b321-bb46-4bb6-a9ea-dcd37c6df004" page="12" coords="56.692902,124.417969,290.547058,124.417969,56.692902,109.884705,290.547058,109.884705,56.692902,112.422775,290.576965,112.422775,56.692902,97.889511,290.576965,97.889511,56.692902,100.427567,290.514587,100.427567,56.692902,85.894302,290.514587,85.894302,56.692902,88.432373,290.537476,88.432373,56.692902,73.899109,290.537476,73.899109" rect="56.238739,73.444946,291.031128,124.872131" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Any elite athlete may be at risk for disordered eating,&#xD;regardless of gender, age, body composition, or sporttype.&#xD;Broad screening is needed to detect those at risk.&#xD;Both population-general and athlete-specific factors </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>have independent associations with disordered eating,&#xD;including pressures (pressures for thinness and&#xD;weight-loss from within sport) and psychological processes&#xD;(drive for thinness, drive for leanness for performance,&#xD;and athletic identity). These correlates can be&#xD;considered in practice through changes to policy, procedure,&#xD;and interventions for disordered eating, and in&#xD;future research through longitudinal investigations of&#xD;the direction of these relationships and the potential&#xD;mediating role of the psychological processes.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="12" rect="595.276001,32.417969,779.276001,124.417969"
/></highlight
></annots
